sequenceDiagram
    participant Sim as Simulator
    participant S as Source i
    participant St as Statistics
    participant ДВ as SelectionDispatcher (ДВ)
    participant ДП as PlacementDispatcher (ДП)
    participant D as Devices[1..4]
    participant B as Buffer (cap. 20)

    Note over Sim: run(): while hasNextEvent(), step() takes the earliest<br/>event — an arrival (nextArrivingSource()) or a service<br/>end (nextFinishingDevice()), and a service end goes first on a tie

    loop every step() whose earliest event is an arrival of source i (ИЗ2 — uniform intervals)
        Sim->>Sim: currentTime = i.getNextArrivalTime()
        Sim->>S: generateNextRequest()
        Note right of S: next interval ~ U(a, b), per ИЗ2
        S-->>Sim: Request r (label i.k)
        Sim->>St: recordArrival(r)
        Sim->>Sim: events.add(GENERATED, r)
        Sim->>ДВ: tryServeDirectly(r)
        ДВ->>ДВ: isBatchActive()
        ДВ-->>ДВ: true / false
        opt no batch is active
            ДВ->>ДВ: selectFreeDevice()
            ДВ->>D: scan from pointer: isFree()?
            D-->>ДВ: first free device k, or none
        end
    
        alt no batch active AND a free device k was found
            Note right of ДВ: Д2П2 — round-robin: first free<br/>device scanning from the pointer
            ДВ->>ДВ: advancePointer(index of k)
            ДВ->>D: k.startService(r, r.getGenerationTime())
            Note right of D: service time ~ Exp(λ), per ПЗ1
            D-->>ДВ: service end time
            ДВ-->>Sim: true (served directly)
            Sim->>St: recordServiceStart(r)
            Sim->>Sim: events.add(SENT_TO_DEVICE, r, k)
        else a batch is active, OR all 4 devices are busy
            ДВ-->>Sim: false
            Note over Sim,ДВ: r may NOT bypass an active batch.<br/>Invariant I — while currentBatch has<br/>unassigned members, no device is idle,<br/>so there is nothing to dispatch here.
            Sim->>ДП: onRequestArrival(r)
            ДП->>B: isFull()
            B-->>ДП: true / false
            alt buffer has a free slot
                Note right of ДП: Д1ОЗ3 — first free slot<br/>from the start, no shifting
                ДП->>B: placeRequest(r)
                ДП-->>Sim: Optional.empty() (nothing refused)
            else buffer full (all 20 slots)
                Note right of ДП: Д1ОО2 — refuse the buffered<br/>request whose source has the<br/>lowest priority (newest on a tie)
                ДП->>ДП: applyRefusalDiscipline(now)
                ДП->>B: findLowestPriorityRequest()
                B-->>ДП: r_old (lowest priority)
                ДП->>B: remove(r_old)
                ДП->>ДП: r_old.markRefused(now)
                ДП->>B: placeRequest(r)
                ДП-->>Sim: Optional.of(r_old) (refused)
                Sim->>St: recordRefusal(r_old)
                Sim->>Sim: events.add(REFUSED, r_old)
            end
            Sim->>Sim: events.add(SENT_TO_BUFFER, r)
        end
    end

    Note over D,B: ... simulated time passes, and the earliest event is now<br/>the service end of device k, which was serving r_prev ...

    Sim->>Sim: currentTime = k.getServiceEndTime()
    Sim->>D: k.completeService()
    D-->>Sim: Request r_prev (now SERVED)
    Sim->>St: recordServiceEnd(r_prev)
    Sim->>Sim: events.add(SERVICE_FINISHED, r_prev, k)
    Sim->>ДВ: onDeviceFree(device k, now)

    ДВ->>ДВ: batchDevices.remove(device k)
    Note right of ДВ: no effect if k served a direct<br/>request — a device leaves<br/>batchDevices only here, when its<br/>service has actually finished

    alt currentBatch AND batchDevices both empty (batch fully processed, or none active)
        ДВ->>ДВ: formNewBatch()
        ДВ->>B: highestPrioritySourcePresent()
        B-->>ДВ: OptionalInt sourceId (empty if buffer is empty)
        opt buffer had a waiting request
            Note right of ДВ: Д2Б5 — freeze a NEW batch:<br/>pull ALL requests of that source<br/>currently in the buffer. Requests<br/>from it that arrive AFTER this<br/>point do NOT join this batch.
            ДВ->>B: removeAllFromSource(sourceId)
            B-->>ДВ: List [r1, r2, ...]
            ДВ->>ДВ: sort oldest first → currentBatch,<br/>formedBatchCount++
        end
    else currentBatch empty, but batchDevices not empty
        Note right of ДВ: the active batch is still being<br/>processed on other devices —<br/>the NEXT batch may not form yet.<br/>dispatchBatch() will find nothing.
    else currentBatch still has unassigned members
        Note right of ДВ: the active batch continues
    end

    ДВ->>ДВ: dispatchBatch(now)
    loop while currentBatch not empty AND selectFreeDevice() finds a device
        ДВ->>D: scan from pointer: isFree()?
        D-->>ДВ: first free device j (device k, or one left idle earlier)
        Note right of ДВ: Д2П2 — round-robin selection
        ДВ->>ДВ: advancePointer(index of j)
        ДВ->>ДВ: r_next = currentBatch.pollFirst()
        ДВ->>ДВ: batchDevices.add(device j)
        Note right of ДВ: take + add are atomic — two<br/>statements of this one handler,<br/>no event can run in between
        ДВ->>D: j.startService(r_next, now)
        Note right of D: service time ~ Exp(λ), per ПЗ1
    end
    Note right of ДВ: every device still free here stays<br/>idle — either no batch member is<br/>left, or the buffer was empty
    ДВ-->>Sim: List of requests started (possibly empty)
    opt formedBatchCount grew
        Sim->>Sim: events.add(PACKET_FORMED, "source s, n request(s)")
    end
    loop each started request r_s
        Sim->>St: recordServiceStart(r_s)
        Sim->>Sim: events.add(TAKEN_FROM_PACKET, r_s, its device)
    end

    Note over Sim,D: If request r is buffered, it is served when a batch<br/>containing it is formed. This happens only when its<br/>source has the highest priority among sources in the<br/>buffer and the previous batch has fully finished.
    Note over Sim: after each step() the events go to every<br/>SimulationListener (step mode prints them)
